  "post_title": "Pugnator gana el I certamen Rock en vivo Rellamp de Onda",
  "post_date": "2016-10-01 09:15:09",
  "post_name": "pugnator-gana-el-certamen-rock-en-vivo-rellamp-de-onda",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias|Política",
  "post_content": "<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\">(75 fotos) El grupo de metal Pugnator ha ganado el I certamen Rock en vivo Rellamp de Onda, cuya final se ha disputado la noche de este viernes en el local de la asociaci&oacute;n, despu&eacute;s de que la semana pasada se supendiera por la lluvia.</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/10/IMG_3004.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\">Adem&aacute;s de tener el honor de acompa&ntilde;ar a La Ranamanca, La Ra&iacute;z, Auxili y Mash Master en concierto del primer s&aacute;bado de Fira, 22 de octubre, se han embolsado<span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;1000 euros. El segundo clasificado ha sido Colombo, que ha conseguido 300 euros, y el tercero, con 200 euros, ha sido para los noveles Epicentre. </span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">En el certame han participado nueve grupos, con todos o algunos de sus componentes de Onda. Tras dar a conocer el veredicto el jurado, ha actuado el grupo funky Gorila.</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrellamp16/colombohq.jpg\" alt=\"colombohq\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrellamp16/epicentrehq.jpg\" alt=\"epicentrehq\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrellamp16/img_0551.jpg\" alt=\"img_0551\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrellamp16/img_0552.jpg\" alt=\"img_0552\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrellamp16/img_0553.jpg\" alt=\"img_0553\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrellamp16/img_0554.jpg\" alt=\"img_0554\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrellamp16/img_0555.jpg\" alt=\"img_0555\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrellamp16/img_0556.jpg\" alt=\"img_0556\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrellamp16/img_0557.jpg\" alt=\"img_0557\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrellamp16/img_0559.jpg\" alt=\"img_0559\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrellamp16/img_0561.jpg\" alt=\"img_0561\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrellamp16/img_0562.jpg\" alt=\"img_0562\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrellamp16/img_0563.jpg\" alt=\"img_0563\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrellamp16/pugnatohq.jpg\" alt=\"pugnatohq\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrellamp16/img_2996.jpg\" alt=\"img_2996\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/certamenrellamp16/img_2998.jpg\" alt=\"img_2998\" style=\"max-width:100%;heig